{"key": "ec5b488fd6ea7ddb10051903", "model": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash", "content": "**No, we cannot purchase the 5-litre gaskets from a supplier without a valid food-grade certificate.**\n\n### Why:\n* **Food Contact Item:** The 5-litre silicone gasket (`GSK-SIL-05L`) is designated in Bahi as a direct **food-contact component** (`food_contact: true`).\n* **Quality & Compliance Policy:** For all food-contact materials used in our cookware, company quality standards and food safety regulations strictly require an active, valid food-grade certificate. Bahi flags any purchase order for food-contact parts from suppliers lacking a valid certificate with a compliance warning.\n\n---\n\n### Current Status on 5L Gaskets:\n* **Deccan Polymers (`DP-RJK-0042`):** Contract rate \u20b911.90 / pc \u2014 **Food-grade certificate: Valid**.\n* **Kaveri Rubber Products (`KR-KOL-0063`):** Lower contract rate at \u20b911.10 / pc \u2014 however, their **food-grade certificate is currently expired**.\n\n### Next Steps:\nIf you want to take advantage of lower pricing (such as Kaveri's \u20b911.10 rate or an uncertified supplier):\n1. Request an updated, valid food-grade compliance certificate from the supplier.\n2. Have QA verify and update their vendor master profile in Bahi.\n3. Once the certificate is validated in the system, we can proceed with raising the purchase order.", "tool_calls": [], "tokens_in": 3430, "tokens_out": 317, "seconds": 9.636}
